guide five-friends-43-48/08-maraudon-finish
title 08 - Maraudon & Final Rewards (48-49)
faction Horde
levels 48-49
zone map 1443
coords live
category Leveling
folder Five Friends 43-48
keywords group, horde, dungeon, five friends
version 3
Five-player quest route. Level band 48-49 is an estimate, not a grind requirement.

step Maraudon quest pickups
  accept 7067 "The Pariah's Instructions" lvl 39 -- Centaur Pariah, roaming southern Desolace: The Pariah's Instructions.
  accept 7029 "Vyletongue Corruption" lvl 41 @23.2,70.2 -- Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village: Vyletongue Corruption.
  accept 7028 "Twisted Evils" lvl 41 @62.1,39.6 -- Willow at Kormek's Hut: Twisted Evils.
  accept 7064 "Corruption of Earth and Seed" lvl 45 @26.9,77.7 -- Selendra near Shadowprey: Horde Corruption of Earth and Seed, requires level 45.

step Maraudon entrance pickup
  accept 7044 "Legends of Maraudon" lvl 41 -- Cavindra in the orange-side exterior caverns: Legends of Maraudon.

step Exterior preparation
  tip Cavindra and the first three khans are outside the instance. Keep the filled Coated Cerulean Vial for the orange-wing plants. The two remaining khans are inside, one in each wing.
  complete 7068 "Shadowshard Fragments" -- Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments per player in the purple-side exterior caverns.
  task "Kill the Nameless Prophet for the Amulet of Spirits; use it on Kolk in the central exterior, Gelk in the purple exterior, and Magra in the orange exterior; loot all three gems"
  task "Fill Vark's empty vial at the orange-entrance pool before going inside"

step Maraudon readiness
  tip This is a full orange wing + purple wing + Princess clear. Do not use a Princess-only shortcut. Keep bag space for the khan gems, scepter pieces, quest loot, and Rotgrip/Princess water.
  task "All five have Legends, Pariah, Vyletongue, Twisted Evils, Corruption, Rot and Regret, An'she's Radiance and Shadowshards as applicable"

step Orange wing
  tip The vial quest counts the resulting healing credits; it does not require eight distinct plants. Collect Theradric Crystal Carvings from eligible dungeon enemies throughout the run.
  complete 7029 "Vyletongue Corruption" -- Use the filled vial at the red Vylestem plants; defeat the spawned Noxxious Scions until all eight healing credits are recorded.
  task "Kill Noxxion for the Celebrian Rod, and reveal/defeat Veng, the Fifth Khan, in the orange wing for his gem"

step Purple wing and the khan gems
  tip Finish both wings before moving through Celebras toward the inner dungeon. Do not discard the scepter pieces.
  task "Kill Lord Vyletongue for the Celebrian Diamond and reveal/defeat Maraudos, the Fourth Khan, in the purple wing"
  complete 7067 "The Pariah's Instructions" -- With all five khan gems and the Amulet of Spirits, right-click a gem to combine them into the Amulet of Union.

step Celebras
  complete 7044 "Legends of Maraudon" -- Bring the Celebrian Rod and Celebrian Diamond, defeat Celebras the Cursed, then speak to Celebras the Redeemed.
  turnin 7044 "Legends of Maraudon" xp 6650 -- Celebras the Redeemed.
  accept 7046 "The Scepter of Celebras" lvl 41 -- Take The Scepter of Celebras.

step Scepter ritual
  complete 7046 "The Scepter of Celebras" -- Follow Celebras's dialogue and ritual; everyone obtains their quest credit.
  turnin 7046 "The Scepter of Celebras" xp 11100 -- Celebras the Redeemed.

step Inner Maraudon bosses
  tip After the Princess dies, accept Seed of Life below BEFORE dropping into the pool for Rotgrip and the water.
  complete 96776 "An'she's Radiance" -- Loot An'she's Radiance from the FIXED CRYSTAL beside Landslide in the inner crystal chamber; it is not his ordinary boss loot.
  complete 7064 "Corruption of Earth and Seed" group 5 -- Kill Princess Theradras.

step Seed of Life pickup
  accept 7066 "Seed of Life" lvl 39 -- Zaetar's Spirit in the Princess area; accept before leaving the instance.

step Rotgrip water and final collection check
  tip Rot and Regret is not complete in the dungeon. Its remaining objective is to use the water on the burning treant back in Shen'dralas.
  collect 258296 "Vial of Earth Song Water" x1 quest 93404.1 -- Loot the geyser in the eastern Rotgrip pool under the stone bridge; keep it for the burning treant.
  complete 7028 "Twisted Evils" -- Finish 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings per player.
  task "Finish the full clear, kill Rotgrip, and confirm every player has the water, An'she's Radiance, scepter, amulet and Seed of Life"

step Desolace hand-ins
  tip At the 13% assumption the lowest member should reach 48 around this block. The remaining deliveries provide the margin and are needed in the 3% sensitivity case.
  turnin 7067 "The Pariah's Instructions" xp 10650 -- Centaur Pariah.
  turnin 7029 "Vyletongue Corruption" xp 10250 @23.2,70.2 -- Vark Battlescar, Shadowprey Village.
  turnin 7028 "Twisted Evils" xp 10250 @62.1,39.6 -- Willow, Kormek's Hut.
  turnin 7064 "Corruption of Earth and Seed" xp 11900 @26.9,77.7 -- Selendra near Shadowprey.

step Restore the tree
  zone map 2652
  complete 93404 "Rot and Regret" -- Return to Shen'dralas and use Earth Song Water on the massive burning treant beside Woodwyrd before reporting to him.

step Rot and Regret reward
  tip Corpsefeeder's Carapace is an optional bonus from an elite encounter. Use any already-held starter and deliver it to Kog'thug when convenient; no extra search or respawn wait is part of this route.
  turnin 93404 "Rot and Regret" xp 11100 @69.5,71.9 -- Woodwyrd.

step An'she's Radiance reward
  zone map 1412
  turnin 96776 "An'she's Radiance" xp 11900 @32.6,24.1 -- Olana Brighthoof, Skywatcher Plateau.

step Shadowshard reward
  zone map 1454
  turnin 7068 "Shadowshard Fragments" xp 6750 @39.0,86.1 -- Uthel'nay, Orgrimmar.

step The Spider God reward
  zone map 1411
  turnin 2936 "The Spider God" xp 9700 @55.9,74.7 -- Master Gadrin, Sen'jin Village.

step Seed of Life delivery
  zone map 1450
  tip Use a known travel route or a mage portal as available. The group is not assumed to share the druid's Teleport: Moonglade. Count this XP only when each player reaches Remulos and hands it in.
  turnin 7066 "Seed of Life" xp 11900 -- Keeper Remulos, Moonglade.

step All planned quest rewards complete
  tip Finish every scheduled quest hand-in and dungeon reward. The level band is approximate: do not grind solely to reach a displayed number before completing this guide. Optional quest starters and incidental kills can change the result.
  task "Finished: every required group objective, dungeon quest and reward delivery checked"
